- 状态：发现 0 个 P0 级别严重问题，2 个 P1 级别问题，3 个 P2 级别问题\n\n---\n\n## 各方向发现\n\n### GitHub Issues ✅\n发现了 5 个新候选：\n\n**P1 - High 优先级：**\n1. **#58457** - [Bug]: Ollama Cloud provider returns HTTP 401 despite valid API key (v2026.3.28)\n   - 类型：bug + regression\n   - 影响：Ollama Cloud provider 完全失效\n\n2. **#58437** - [Bug]: Live session model switch detection causes infinite retry loop, deadlocking entire agent after upgrade to 2026.3.28\n   - 类型：bug + regression\n   - 影响：Agent 死锁，无法响应\n\n**P2 - Medium 优先级：**\n3. **#58443** - [Bug]: Gateway duplicates inbound messages — same message in\n\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L1-L48","source":"memory","citation":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L1-L48"},{"id":"0a6aa42e1852a8760bd466c4ec5f207e42fadac9545f5fe04e4064f47e7dd9be","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":925,"endLine":953,"score":0.7923703932695978,"textScore":0.7923703932695978,"snippet":"1. `TelegramExecApprovalHandler.handleGatewayEvent()` 只处理 `exec.approval.requested/resolved`，忽略 `plugin.approval.requested/resolved`\n  2. Grammy runner sequentializer 将 callback_query 排队在等待 approval 的 agent message 后面，死锁\n- **影响**：\n  1. Plugin approval buttons 显示 \"loading\" 然后什么都没发生\n  2. Agent 挂起直到 approval timeout（300s 默认）\n  3. Timeout 后 tool 被拒绝\n- **可修性**：M（Issue 1: 添加 plugin.approval.* 事件处理；Issue 2: 添加 pre-sequentializer middleware 拦截 approval callback_query）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（已有 PR #57340）\n- **代码位置**：`extensions/telegram/src/exec-approvals-handler.ts` line 361\n\n---\n\n## 2026-03-29 23:42 UTC 扫描\n\n### 扫描摘要\n- **时间范围**：2026-03-29 21:42 UTC → 23:42 UTC（过去 120 分钟）\n- **新 open issues**：21 个（已排除已覆盖项\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L925-L953","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L925-L953"},{"id":"8258b2309d392665e7d516aa56903108c2c64cb473763613f918c3f3f431ad02","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1925,"endLine":1930,"score":0.7791575602645069,"textScore":0.7791575602645069,"snippet":"| 57547 | bug+usability gap | webchat cannot display images | P2 | 未覆盖 | webchat 前端无法渲染图像，即使后端返回图像数据（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 57348 | bug | [Bug]: VS Code ACP prompts hang with OpenClaw on Windows after sendPrompt | P2 | 未覆盖 | WebSocket 连接失败，HTTP fallback 后仍然挂起，Gateway disconnected: 1006，connect ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:18789（相关 #55523） |\n| 57339 | bug | Telegram: plugin approval buttons don't work (handler missing plugin.approval.* events) | P2 | 未覆盖 | TelegramExecApprovalHandler 只处理 exec.approval.* 事件，忽略 plugin.approval.*；Grammy runner sequentializer 导致 callback_query 死锁（已有 PR #57340） |\n| 57241 | bug+regression | [Bug]: tailscale.mode \"serve\" overwrites Funnel to tailnet-only on every gateway r\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1925-L1930","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1925-L1930"},{"id":"dea4b831c7590531cbd598df39426dba94852bb3c8c8b6d8ecdd3c6c579a62ab","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":465,"endLine":513,"score":0.7485118112293012,"textScore":0.7485118112293012,"snippet":"- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：中（API 认证失败）\n- **root cause**：使用 API 调用 OpenClaw API 时，持续返回 \"missing scope: operator.write\" 错误\n- **影响**：\n  1. API 调用失败\n  2. 外部集成受阻\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n**#58214** - [Bug]:  飞书偶现：401 Incorrect API key provided\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：中（Feishu 鉴权失败）\n- **root cause**：飞书偶现 401 Incorrect API key provided 错误\n- **影响**：\n  1. Feishu channel 偶尔鉴权失败\n  2. 消息投递不稳定\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n**#58219** - sessions_send: isFallbackRetry replaces message content with recovery prompt\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：中（sessions_send 行为问题）\n- **root cause**：sessions_send 的 isFallbackRetry 用 recovery prompt 替换消息内容\n- **影\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L465-L513","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L465-L513"},{"id":"14545e74a6351aa7bdc6889ffb29ff354b34eafe05fe5fa40e938e7cf41fdc04","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1250,"endLine":1271,"score":0.7425191622545174,"textScore":0.7425191622545174,"snippet":"- **root cause**：stopLaunchAgent() 使用 `launchctl bootout` 而不是 `launchctl stop`\n- **影响**：每次 stop 后都需要重新运行 `openclaw gateway install` 才能再次 start，破坏自动化重启脚本和 watchdog 恢复系统\n- **可修性**：S（替换 `bootout` 为 `stop`）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#57115** - Gateway startup hangs when previous process exists as zombie (PID alive but port not listening)\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：高（无法启动 gateway）\n- **root cause**：Gateway lock 检测只检查 PID 存在，没有检查端口是否实际监听\n- **影响**：当 gateway 进程变成僵尸状态时，无法启动新的 gateway，命令无限挂起\n- **可修性**：M（需要增强 lock 检测逻辑，添加端口健康检查）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#57133** - [Bug]: NO_REPLY envelope leakage - agent self-talk and internal tokens delivered to Telegram as visible messages\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：中高（（202\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1250-L1271","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1250-L1271"},{"id":"4670c029a0502ee4146b033f63fc0d2b1aa2f2e08a5e2a983a08491b2982785e","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":500,"endLine":546,"score":0.7410359630792326,"textScore":0.7410359630792326,"snippet":"- **root cause**：issue 标题为空\n- **影响**：具体问题不明确\n- **可修性**：未知\n- **推荐**：等待补充信息\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n#### InStreet 社区发现\n\n无（访问的是 API 文档，不是社区讨论）\n\n#### Discord 社区发现\n\n无（Discussions 已禁用）\n\n#### 插件仓库发现\n\n无（weixin 代码不公开，其他插件仓库未扫描到新 issues）\n\n---\n\n## 2026-03-30 09:00 UTC 扫描\n\n### 扫描摘要\n- **时间范围**：2026-03-30 07:00 UTC → 09:00 UTC（过去 120 分钟）\n- **新 open issues**：8 个（已排除已覆盖项）\n- **新 open PRs**：2 个（已排除已覆盖项）\n- **状态**：发现 1 个 P0 级别安全问题，2 个 P1 级别问题，2 个 P2 级别问题\n\n### 关键发现\n\n#### P0 - Critical 问题\n\n**#57588** - [Feature]: Security: fetch-auth bearer token fallback attaches tokens to arbitrary URLs without fail-closed defaults\n- **类型**：security + bug\n- **严重度**：极高（安全漏洞）\n- **root cause**：fetch-auth bearer token fallback 将 to\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L500-L546","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L500-L546"}],"provider":"none","citations":"auto","mode