epository \\\"openclaw/openclaw\\\" and focusing on the range around 587xx. This should help in finding the most relevant information quickly and efficiently. Let’s see what results I can pull up that can really clarify things!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"GitHub 和社区页我再缩小一轮，直接按最新 issue 段位抓。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_03b16164283741870169cd6c17640481919cb4005b9c939261\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_PrED8raF4nYitjeghoe0quOe|fc_03b16164283741870169cd6c18a59c8191a7dc00a99c071f00","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/587 openclaw","count":10},"partialJson":"{\"query\":\"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/587 openclaw\", \"count\":10}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8cPA6e4rs7XGugXBu1dJ04ih|fc_03b16164283741870169cd6c18a5ac8191a699bf67c26aca6a","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/588 openclaw","count":10},"partialJson":"{\"query\":\"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/588 openclaw\", \"count\":10}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_lg8oiaA8ACZod91kMsU2aRjn|fc_03b16164283741870169cd6c18a5b08191a1bc8f4874a94019","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/587 openclaw","count":10},"partialJson":"{\"query\":\"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/587 openclaw\", \"count\":10}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rJiNDxLC2Z3641aZNqXClJFh|fc_03b16164283741870169cd6c18a5b88191ba587a1c298f271c","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/discussions openclaw bug help beta releases","count":10},"partialJson":"{\"query\":\"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/discussions openclaw bug help beta releases\", \"count\":10}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":7313,"output":223,"cacheRead":112256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":119792,"cost":{"input":0.0182825,"output":0.003345,"cacheRead":0.028064,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.049691